@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我们来到监牢二楼的图书室，<br>发现雪莉、汉娜和艾玛正待在阅读区。|#0201Adv13_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚被图书室中央的大树吸引住了，<br>开始构思要画些什么，<br>于是我独自走向雪莉她们。|#0201Adv13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们在做什么？|#0201Adv13_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:纪律委员大驾光临了哇……|#0201Adv13_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我可不是什么纪律委员。|#0201Adv13_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:每天巡视好几次我们的房间，<br>不是纪律委员是什么啊……|#0201Adv13_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗！我们今天<br>正在调查图书室的各种书籍呢！|#0201Adv13_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，想着也许能更了解一些<br>这座监牢的情况。|#0201Adv13_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:但都是些看不懂的书，<br>正头疼着呢。|#0201Adv13_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果能掌握规律的话，<br>或许就能大致解读了～|#0201Adv13_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我也大致浏览了一下图书室的书，<br>　确实都是些看不懂的东西……）|#0201Adv13_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了对了。<br>希罗，请看这个！|#0201Adv13_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉指着桌上的一本厚书。|#0201Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『魔女の本』表示
; ========================================
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
; 番号仮入れ。魔女の本を表示する
; @spawn Clue params:10-1
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:那是一本装帧华丽、看起来就有什么特殊内情的书。|#0201Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry

[PrintTextModified Text:这本书似乎记载了<br>有关魔女和魔法的内容。|#0201Adv13_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @despawn Clue
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:1

; 本のページをぱらぱらめくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_43 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我也注意到了翻开的那一页。|#0201Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_36_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:510_1

[PrintTextModified Text:用独特文字写就的如此厚重的书籍……<br>看来并不只是装饰品那么简单。|#0201Adv13_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来监牢的运营方似乎拥有与我们不同的<br>文化和历史。|#0201Adv13_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（恐怕是魔女……相关的东西吧）|#0201Adv13_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Duration:0.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:80,30 AppearanceAndTransition:510_1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……我很在意这幅画。|#0201Adv13_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我指着的这幅画上，<br>众多魔女手牵手围在一起，<br>一名威严十足的魔女正在降临。|#0201Adv13_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这画的不是【魔女安息仪式】吗？<br>就是魔女召唤大魔女的仪式之类的。|#0201Adv13_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来如此？<br>虽然不太了解，但确实在一般的传说中，<br>魔女似乎也有首领。|#0201Adv13_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对魔女来说【大魔女】是<br>不可或缺的存在……对，也就是说！|#0201Adv13_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说……！|#0201Adv13_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills,Stills-Middle Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.6
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉竖起食指，正要说些什么，<br>却静止了一会，发出嗯～～的声音陷入苦思。|#0201Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯～！如果能解读出文字的话，<br>就能知道里面写了什么详细内容了～|#0201Adv13_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然轻率推理很危险……<br>但如果按照这本书来考虑的话<br>运营方可能也是魔女一方。|#0201Adv13_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长之前说到一半停下了：<br>“只要找到大魔女，诅咒就能……”什么的。|#0201Adv13_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，这个荒唐的游戏<br>很可能是魔女一方为了召唤大魔女而举行的仪式。<br>|#0201Adv13_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～！就是这个～！<br>我也想说这个来着！|#0201Adv13_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false ScenePositionX:50 ScenePositionY:50

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗真不赖啊～！<br>说不定我们能组成名侦探搭档什么的！|#0201Adv13_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还是免了。|#0201Adv13_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉亲昵地贴近，<br>但我并不讨厌。|#0201Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，即便如此……<br>为何我们非得被绑架到这里来呢？|#0201Adv13_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直在读另一本书的汉娜<br>烦躁地开口道。|#0201Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:关于这点我也有几个假设。|#0201Adv13_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想要召唤大魔女的运营方，<br>特意聚集了这么多预备魔女的理由……|#0201Adv13_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我竖起食指，<br>吸引雪莉和汉娜的注意。|#0201Adv13_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:第一种假设，召唤大魔女需要少女死亡。<br>很简单——就是所谓的祭品。|#0201Adv13_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:太糟糕了哇……|#0201Adv13_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无视汉娜寒毛耸立的样子，<br>我平静地竖起第二根手指。|#0201Adv13_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:第二种……这可能有点跳跃。<br>目的并不是杀害少女。<br>而是让少女们聚在一起。|#0201Adv13_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:比如说，如果她们是为了召唤大魔女<br>而【正在寻找某种魔法】呢？|#0201Adv13_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:请稍等。<br>第二种可能性，当真存在吗？|#0201Adv13_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:若只是想了解魔法的话<br>没必要大费周章<br>将我们囚禁在这种地方吧……！|#0201Adv13_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:规则手册不是写着吗。<br>随着魔女化程度加深，魔法会进化。|#0201Adv13_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就目前看来，每个人的魔法都不一样。<br>魔法会进化成什么样，运营方肯定也不知道。|#0201Adv13_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果我们的魔法进化后<br>出现了运营方想要的魔法呢？|#0201Adv13_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这座监牢就是<br>促进我们尽快魔女化的养殖场……<br>这样考虑的话，有些地方就说得通了。|#0201Adv13_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……关于魔法和魔女还有很多不明之处<br>所以无法断定，但也不能否定呢。|#0201Adv13_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜似乎无言以对，<br>有些愕然地看着我。|#0201Adv13_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……希罗。<br>你是什么时候想到这些的？|#0201Adv13_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:关于召唤大魔女的仪式我刚刚才知道。<br>当然是刚刚才想到的。|#0201Adv13_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:真、真不想和你敌对呢……|#0201Adv13_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:……是啊。<br>希罗很厉害的。|#0201Adv13_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一直沉默的艾玛开口了。<br>我看向艾玛……又移开了视线。|#0201Adv13_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也不想和你们敌对。<br>我该走了。时间有限——|#0201Adv13_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我向她们告别，<br>朝着大树前的诺亚走去。|#0201Adv13_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:53 IdAndAppearance:Noah

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚举着喷漆，<br>似乎想给大树上色。|#0201Adv13_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:3.5 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:12_1 SubId:Middle
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_34_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:——喂，诺亚，你想干什么？|#0201Adv13_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗。<br>嘿嘿，诺亚在想，如果把这棵树涂得五颜六色<br>一定会超级棒的。|#0201Adv13_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家肯定会很高兴的～！|#0201Adv13_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:驳回。|#0201Adv13_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～不行吗～？明明一定会变得很漂亮的～|#0201Adv13_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……快走吧。<br>在图书室要保持安静。|#0201Adv13_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我半拖着依依不舍的诺亚<br>离开了图书室。|#0201Adv13_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

