[PrintTextModified Text:（魔法会变强……吗）|#0201Adv13_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（也许，强大得超乎想像的魔法<br>　会在我们之中诞生……）|#0201Adv13_Hiro028|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一丝微弱的骚动，悄然在我心中萌生。|#0201Adv13_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

